WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.412 --> 00:00:03.407
打开 Rules / Open Rules

2
00:00:03.407 --> 00:00:06.404
新建根目录 / Create a root folder

3
00:00:06.404 --> 00:00:09.353
命名 Guide hierarchy / Name it Guide hierarchy

4
00:00:09.353 --> 00:00:12.755
通过目录菜单新建子目录 / Create a child through the folder menu

5
00:00:12.755 --> 00:00:15.705
命名 Guide API / Name it Guide API

6
00:00:15.705 --> 00:00:19.104
新建第三级目录 / Create the third folder level

7
00:00:19.104 --> 00:00:22.056
命名 Guide final / Name it Guide final

8
00:00:22.056 --> 00:00:25.106
核对不能继续新建第四级目录 / Verify a fourth folder level is unavailable

9
00:00:25.106 --> 00:00:28.204
在第三级新建规则 / Create a Rule in the third-level folder

10
00:00:28.204 --> 00:00:31.156
检查未填写字段与Apply禁用 / Inspect missing fields and disabled Apply

11
00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:34.113
命名 Guide nested priority / Name the Rule Guide nested priority

12
00:00:34.113 --> 00:00:37.065
限定Host为127.0.0.1 / Restrict Host to 127.0.0.1

13
00:00:37.065 --> 00:00:40.415
添加Path条件 / Add a Path condition

14
00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:43.411
限定本轮规则路径 / Restrict this run’s Rule path

15
00:00:43.411 --> 00:00:46.417
填写x-guide-tree / Enter x-guide-tree

16
00:00:46.417 --> 00:00:49.404
填写nested / Enter nested

17
00:00:49.404 --> 00:00:52.365
启用完整规则 / Enable the completed Rule

18
00:00:52.365 --> 00:00:55.404
Apply目录与规则 / Apply the folders and Rule

19
00:00:55.404 --> 00:00:58.753
在菜单中重命名目录 / Rename the folder through its menu

20
00:00:58.753 --> 00:01:01.713
将Guide API改为Guide routes / Rename Guide API to Guide routes

21
00:01:01.713 --> 00:01:04.705
Apply目录名称 / Apply the folder name

22
00:01:04.705 --> 00:01:07.662
按目录名称搜索 / Search by folder name

23
00:01:07.662 --> 00:01:10.653
清空Rules搜索 / Clear Rules search

24
00:01:10.653 --> 00:01:13.655
折叠根目录 / Collapse the root folder

25
00:01:13.655 --> 00:01:16.606
展开原来的目录 / Expand the same folder again

26
00:01:16.606 --> 00:01:23.454
发送匹配请求核对nested / Send a matching request and verify nested

27
00:01:23.454 --> 00:01:26.454
打开命中规则的菜单 / Open the matched Rule menu

28
00:01:26.454 --> 00:01:29.605
跳转到这条规则的请求 / Navigate to this Rule’s requests

29
00:01:29.605 --> 00:01:32.554
展开并核对已选规则分组 / Expand and verify the selected Rule facet

30
00:01:32.554 --> 00:01:35.504
检查导航选中的匹配请求 / Inspect the matched request selected by navigation

31
00:01:35.504 --> 00:01:38.465
查看Header设置标记 / Inspect the Header set marker

32
00:01:38.465 --> 00:01:41.506
点击标记返回同一规则 / Follow the marker to the same Rule

33
00:01:41.506 --> 00:01:44.462
打开根级菜单 / Open the root-level menu

34
00:01:44.462 --> 00:01:47.463
从根菜单新建顺序对照规则 / Create a precedence comparison Rule at the root

35
00:01:47.463 --> 00:01:50.408
命名Guide root priority / Name it Guide root priority

36
00:01:50.408 --> 00:01:53.354
填写同一Host / Enter the same Host

37
00:01:53.354 --> 00:01:56.756
为根规则添加Path / Add Path to the root Rule

38
00:01:56.756 --> 00:01:59.712
填写同一测试路径 / Enter the same example path

39
00:01:59.712 --> 00:02:02.704
填写同一Header / Enter the same Header

40
00:02:02.704 --> 00:02:05.669
填写root作为后写值 / Enter root as the later value

41
00:02:05.669 --> 00:02:08.657
启用根级顺序规则 / Enable the root precedence Rule

42
00:02:08.657 --> 00:02:11.656
Apply两条规则 / Apply both Rules

43
00:02:11.656 --> 00:02:14.560
核对根规则最后覆盖为root / Verify the root Rule writes root last

44
00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:17.515
打开非最后一条规则的删除菜单 / Open deletion for the non-last Rule

45
00:02:17.515 --> 00:02:20.506
只删除Guide nested priority / Delete only Guide nested priority

46
00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:23.504
Apply非最后一条删除 / Apply the non-last deletion

47
00:02:23.504 --> 00:02:26.604
打开空目录的删除菜单 / Open deletion for the empty folder tree

48
00:02:26.604 --> 00:02:29.605
删除已空的三级目录 / Delete the empty three-level folder tree

49
00:02:29.605 --> 00:02:32.604
Apply空目录删除 / Apply empty-folder deletion

50
00:02:32.604 --> 00:02:35.515
核对剩余规则仍正常命中 / Verify the remaining Rule still matches

51
00:02:35.515 --> 00:02:38.560
保留并停用最后一条规则 / Retain and disable the last Rule

52
00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:41.497
Apply停用状态 / Apply the disabled state
